  "Title": "SiYuan: TLS Private Keys Readable via getFile (Incomplete Blocklist)",
  "Description": "`IsForbiddenAbsPath()` only blocks `conf/conf.json` by exact match. The TLS private key (conf/key.pem) and CA private key (conf/ca.key) live in the same conf/ directory and are absent from the blocklist. Any authenticated user can retrieve them via POST `/api/file/getFile`.",
